"Did you?" she says, eyes round with wonder. A cycling melody joins the humming filling the air. "Which aspect? The face? The gears? The caged metaphor? Oh! And did you use tools? The mental interface? Wait. Did you use the consoles?"

She trails off, waving a claw at you. "No! Don't tell me. Answers take all the mystery out of life. Anyway! Can I interest you in some prime artifacts? Dusty relics? Numenera of uncertain origin?"
{SOUND: Same humming as in Node 3 along with a cycling melody}

